---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Uses · Janis Schubert">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Uses</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">Things I work with. Mostly so I remember what I changed and why.</p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold">Hardware</h2>
  <ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5">
    <li>MacBook Pro 14", the fan almost never comes on</li>
    <li>One external 27" display, I tried two and kept turning my head</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold">Software</h2>
  <ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5">
    <li>VS Code for most things, Zed when I want the fan to stay quiet</li>
    <li>Ghostty with zsh, no framework, a handful of aliases and starship for the prompt</li>
    <li>Firefox for browsing, Chrome for devtools</li>
    <li>Bun for scripts, pnpm for projects, and I have stopped arguing about it</li>
  </ul>
</Base>
